      "description": "Describe what you want. Replit builds it — websites, web apps, slides, videos, data dashboards, and more.\n\nNo coding. No tools to learn. Just describe what you need in plain language, and Replit handles the building, testing, debugging, and hosting — all in one place. It's like having an entire team of engineers and designers on demand, available through a simple chat.\n\nTrusted by 50 million creators and builders worldwide.\n\nBUILD ANYTHING\n\nOne platform for everything you want to make:\n\n- Web apps — live in minutes with a public URL\n- Websites and prototypes\n- Slide decks and presentations\n- Videos and animations\n- Data apps and dashboards\n\nDESIGN FREELY\n\nDesign directly on a live canvas. No handoff. No gap between what you picture and what ships.\n\nBUILD TOGETHER\n\nEvery request becomes a structured task your team can track. Add tasks anytime, see progress in real-time, and stay focused on what matters — while Replit handles the maintenance, updates, and complexity in the background.\n\nMOVE FASTER\n\nMultiple AI agents work across your project simultaneously — building infrastructure, integrating services, and refining features at once. What used to take cycles now happens in parallel.\n\nEVERYTHING BUILT IN — ZERO SETUP\n\nAuthentication, database, hosting, and monitoring are all included from day one. No configuration, no infrastructure decisions. Build fully scalable web apps securely from the start.\n\n100+ INTEGRATIONS, NO API KEYS NEEDED\n\nConnect to Google Drive, Gmail, Google Workspace, enterprise data warehouses, and more. Turn your project into a fully connected system in minutes, not days.\n\nSECURE BY DEFAULT\n\nPre-deployment security screening, secure built-in services, and enterprise-grade controls — including SSO/SAML and SOC2 — so what you build stays protected.\n\nWHO USES REPLIT:\n\n- Founders and entrepreneurs building their first product or MVP\n- Designers who want to ship without depending on a developer\n- Product managers building internal tools and prototypes\n- Marketers who need campaign tools and dashboards\n- Students creating real projects for their portfolio\n- Anyone with an idea and no time to waste\n\nCreativity runs on Replit.\n\nGet started for free. Download and build something today.",
